==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Caterpie|96}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*'''Find a Friend''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Togepi|88}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

